  "notes": [
    "All PNGs preserve RGBA source alpha. Existing protectedProbes contain only opaque RGB points; protectedAlphaProbes is explicit additional source truth, not a claim that the current browser runner validates alpha.",
    "Transparent interword holes are computed from fixed font metrics and verified to have zero glyph-mask coverage before compositing. They test repair-patch source preservation without destroying written source text.",
    "No fonts, model weights, third-party artwork or generated AI image are bundled. Font files are external inputs identified by exact SHA256.",
    "A common panel is not asserted to be a common paragraph. Every complete independent label and caption is retained in paragraphGroups."
